Subject: [PATCH 124/132] compiler: Re-resolve loaded symbol tables when a used
 unit is recompiled, patch from Pascal Riekenberg, issue #41970

(cherry picked from commit a7b0e8a2652184f4e19af2063076ca416e256f20, without the two
test programs the upstream commit added as built binaries under tests/tppu/*/ppus)
